I accepted a call to[ serve] as[ pastor][ at][ St][.] Marcus on July[ 1][,] 2016. My pastoral ministry[ began] in Salem, Oregon in 1989[.][ In] 1993 I[ began] pastoring[ a] church in Marietta, Ohio[.][ From] 1998 to 2016 I served as Professor of New Testament and Pastoral Theology at Wisconsin Lutheran[ Sem]inary in Me[qu]on.
I[ have] not found anything more[ rewarding][ than] placing[ the] gospel[ of] Jesus[ Christ] on[ the] hearts[ of][ people]. For that reason[,][ I] really love[ preaching] and teaching the Word of God. A[ special] thrill[ has] been seeing "lights[ go] on" in the[ eyes][ of] people who have never considered the[ gospel] seriously[ before][.][ And][ the] relationships[ that] develop from serving as a group of Christians' spiritual[ shepherd] are[ incredibly][ enrich]ing.[ I] love[ everything] about being a[ pastor]!
