Having decamped for[ Vienna],[ Virginia], Colasante no longer gets up[ at] 3[ in] the[ morning] to move paintings[ around]. But he and his business[ partner] (and former spouse)[ Ma][ureen] Taylor rearrange the display and host special exhibitions every few months[.] From total holdings[ of][ roughly] 4,000 objects, he says they sell 200 to 300 per[ year].
