> ” It may seem surreal[,][ but] as[ work] continues to decommission damaged reactors[ at] the[ Fukushima] No[.] 1[ nuclear] power plant[–][a] project that involves 7,000 or so workers[–][t]ours[ of] the[ complex][ by] outsiders[ are] becoming increasingly popular.
