All[ the] programs[ are][ geared] towards enabling our young graduates to[ become] efficient commun[icators][ in] English/Arabic who[ would] seek[,] with[ confidence][,] employment[ or][ undertake] self[-][employment][ in][ a][ wide][ range] of job[ areas] such[ as] teaching, translating,[ interpreting], secretarial practice, marketing, journalism,[ communication] consultancy[,] translation and[ interpreting] consultancy[,] etc[.][
][Our] programs[ offer] a[ rich] and balanced combination of courses in both the streams of[ language] and translation,[ which] provide[ students] with[ an] enhanced perspective of desired knowledge and[ skills][.]
